<hr>
<h2 id="first-time-setup-workflow" tabindex="-1">First-time setup workflow</h2>
<p>Until the API and database are configured, the UI may guide you through database connection and admin creation (handled by <strong>w4h-api</strong> endpoints, not by direct DB access from the browser):</p>
